            P("On Kubernetes, the server pod's `/tmp` is where backups are staged: set `backend.tmpSize` in the Helm chart larger than a compressed dump of your database, or set `BACKUP_TEMP_DIR` to a larger volume. See [Docker & Kubernetes](kubernetes.html)."),

